  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 2.0.0 Beta 5\n\n### Breaking Changes\n* Removed ``IProcessTimeoutPolicyBuilder`` and ``ProcessTimeoutPolicyBuilder`` - These builders added hardly any benefit for the complexity they added\n* Removed ``IProcessExitConfigurationBuilder`` and ``ProcessExitConfigurationBuilder`` - These builders also added hardly any benefit for the complexity they added\n\n### Improvements\n* Improved robustness of ``ProcessTimeoutPolicy`` parameter checks during creation\n\n### Bug Fixes\n* Fixed an issue where a process meant for graceful cancellation wouldn't be cancelled gracefully",
